W(RC,"What causes stale closures in hooks and how do you fix them?",[["capture","closure","render"],["dependency","deps","dependency array"],["functional update","prev =>","ref","usereducer"],["lint","exhaustive-deps","eslint"]],"Callbacks/effects capture the values from the render they were created in. If dependencies are missing the code sees outdated values. Fix by listing deps, using functional updates, refs for latest value, reducers or restructuring; the exhaustive-deps lint rule catches many cases.");
