W(RC,"What are React Server Components and what problem do they solve?",[["server","no client js","zero bundle","bundle"],["fetch","database","direct","async"],["client component","use client","interactive"],["waterfall","performance","size"]],"RSCs render only on the server, so their code isn't shipped to the browser. They can fetch data directly, reduce bundle size and waterfalls, and compose with client components ('use client') for interactivity. Props crossing the boundary must be serialisable.");
