W(PF,"Explain the critical rendering path.",[["html","dom"],["css","cssom"],["render tree"],["layout","reflow"],["paint","composite"],["blocking","script","defer"]],"HTML is parsed into the DOM and CSS into the CSSOM; they combine into the render tree, then layout computes geometry, paint draws pixels and compositing assembles layers. CSS blocks rendering and synchronous scripts block parsing, so optimise by inlining critical CSS, deferring scripts and minimising critical resources.");
