W(BN,"Explain CORS, including preflight, and how you'd debug a CORS error.",[["origin","same-origin"],["access-control-allow-origin","allow-origin","header"],["preflight","options"],["credentials","cookie"],["server","proxy","devtools","network"]],"Browsers block cross-origin reads unless the server sends Access-Control-Allow-* headers. Non-simple requests trigger an OPTIONS preflight. Credentials need an explicit origin (no wildcard) and Allow-Credentials. Debug in the Network tab: inspect the preflight and response headers; fix on the server or use a same-origin proxy.");
